# Trial by Fire (outlands 12): the reward mask's bit 5 for a char with SMN unlocked. player:hasJob(SMN) reads the unlocked
# jobs, not the main job, so the char first completes I Can Hear a Rainbow (set up by GM: accepted with Prog 1 and a
# Carbuncle's Ruby; the ruby to the qm3 in La Theine Plateau plays its 124, whose finish unlocks SMN: as
# windurst.the_moonlit_path#smn does). Trial by Fire accepted (a GM) with the Whisper of Flames (a GM): Ronta 273 with
# mask 0 (SMN unlocked, no Ifrit, no reward item); option 6: the Ifrit spell, IFRIT_UNLOCKED, completed. A day on: 270,
# option 1: begun again; the whisper (a GM): 273 with mask 32 (the spell known: the hasSpell half); option 5: 10000 gil.
lists Kazham/Ronta-Onta/onTrigger Kazham/onEventFinish/273
char zone=LaTheinePlateau pos=-178.2,8.845,254.327
quest Windurst.ICanHearARainbow accepted
charvar Quest[2][75]Prog 1
item CarbunclesRuby
fame Windurst 425
quest Outlands.TrialByFire accepted
keyitem WhisperOfFlames
login
trade qm3 CarbunclesRuby x1             # I Can Hear a Rainbow, Prog 1: its 124
finish                                  # completed: SMN unlocked, Carbuncle
warp 100.37,-13.999,-97.676 Kazham
trigger Ronta-Onta                      # 273 (0, 1, 0, 0, 0)
finish option=6                         # the Ifrit spell; IFRIT_UNLOCKED; completed; the whisper taken; Timer
wait jst=1
trigger Ronta-Onta                      # 270 (0, fork)
finish option=1                         # the quest deleted and begun again; the fork
keyitem WhisperOfFlames                 # a GM
trigger Ronta-Onta                      # 273 (32: the Ifrit spell)
finish option=5                         # 10000 gil; completed
